# Colossus of the Strait's bolt store (CIPlay colossus_of_the_strait_caves, 11-12 w07; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points
# as in its recipe: the mouth on the strait's floor at 3 16 (4 m down), the culvert climbing under the east headland
# (yaw 110, len 26, slope 18) to the dry room round 35.9 4 (air zone co_boltstore, the builders' chest at 37.2 4.5). Swim in
# from the strait, breathe in the room, take the chest, swim back out.
island Colossus of the Strait keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture co_cave_mouth -6 4 18 3 1 16
walk 0 16 to 3 16 to 12.4 12.6 to 21.8 9.2 to 30 6.3 to 35.5 4.2 below=8
air co_boltstore here
picture co_cave_in 31 10 6 37.5 8.6 4.3 light=20
open Bolt store
wait 2
expect item Bolt 6
air co_boltstore
walk 35.5 4.2 to 30 6.3 to 21.8 9.2 to 12.4 12.6 to 3 16 to 0 16 below=8
picture co_headland -12 10 30 25 10 8
